## Git Workflow

### Commit Messages:
Follow Conventional Commits format:
```
feat: Add targeting system with crosshair
fix: Resolve station input routing issue
docs: Update build documentation
chore: Update .gitignore
refactor: Simplify AI state machine
```

### Always Include Footer:
```
🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
```

---

## File Exclusions

### Never Commit:
- `Binaries/` - Compiled DLLs
- `Intermediate/` - Build artifacts
- `Saved/` - Logs, config overrides
- `*.sln` - Generated solution files
- `Content/Materials/Downloaded/` - Downloaded assets
- `git_token.txt` - Secrets
- `*.log` - Log files

See `.gitignore` for complete list.

